<title>POLAND: PETROBANK MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 64,000.</title>
<headline>PETROBANK MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 64,000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.06 vs    0.47</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.30 vs    0.79</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  5.48 vs    2.80</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 8.76 vs    5.70</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY					 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  6.27 vs    3.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   11.15 vs    5.26</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 28.46 vs   11.86</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	41.15 vs   26.61</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Petrobank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
